While the business has received mostly positive reviews, there have been some complaints about the staff's friendliness. However, many customers rave about the delicious food and relaxed atmosphere. One reviewer particularly enjoyed the salads and cupcakes, while another appreciated the fact that they didn't feel overly full or guilty after eating at the cafe.

